	(text "PWR_FLAG on VBAT: the battery connector drives it. PWR_FLAG on +3V3 and VLED: the rails are driven\nthrough 0-ohm measurement links. SYS is driven by the BQ25620 SYS pin (USB/charger/battery sheet)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 264.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d1a74cc0-209f-4b35-a4b8-59d4e3ece731")
	)
	(text "Regulators and power tree (Rev A) - design notes\n\nPower states: EN_3V3 = switch ON (SYS via R201) OR charger PG (Q203). OFF + battery only: EN low,\n3V3 off. OFF + valid USB: PG low -> 3V3 on for the charging-only firmware mode (display off).\nUSB removed with the switch OFF: PG releases, R202 pulls EN low, 3V3 shuts down in hardware.\nEN <= SYS (< 4.6 V) < 6 V abs max. PWR_SW_N (Q204, open drain) reports the switch to the MCU.\n\nTPS63802 (SLVSEU9D): L 0.37-0.57 uH effective. Boost peak at VIN 2.9 V, 0.5 A design load,\nL 0.37 uH, 1.4 MHz: 1.01 A; x1.2 = 1.21 A required. L201 Isat 5.5 A (Murata, -30% L).\n\nTPS61023 (SLVSF14B), calculated estimate, not a bound: VIN 2.9 V, VOUT 5.33 V, IOUT 0.66 A (32 x 19.4 mA +5 %, logic),\neta 0.8, L 0.72 uH (-20 % tol, -10 % sat), f 0.8 MHz assumed (TI: 1.0 MHz typ, no min): peak 2.94 A.\nCurrent-limit peaks are not bounded by the datasheet: measure at bring-up (release gate).\nL202 XGL4020-102MEC: Isat 3.8/6.3/8.8 A at 10/20/30 % drop, Irms 8.8 A (Coilcraft 1529-1).\nVLED setting is PROVISIONAL (LED testing): 4.77 V typ, VREF 580-610 mV; trims R212/R213.\nBoost only: VLED = max(setting, SYS - drop); SYS ~ VBAT + 50 mV, so useful settings are about 4.4-5.2 V.\nLED_EN low (R214) keeps the boost off with true load disconnect.\n\nVBAT measurement: Q201 off unless VBAT_MEAS_EN is high. Ratio 1/2 (4.2 V -> 2.1 V).\nMCU unpowered: AO3401A IDSS <= 5 uA (55 C) x R221 47k = 0.24 V max at VBAT_SENSE, and\nAO3400A IDSS x R218 = 0.24 V on Q201 gate, below the AO3401A 0.5 V minimum threshold.\n\nValues marked PROVISIONAL or DNP are not validated. Nothing on this sheet is measured."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 299.72 152.4 0)
		(effects
